WEBVTT

00:16:56.441 --> 00:17:01.197
You're working on
philanthropic issues together.

00:17:01.221 --> 00:17:02.384
Tell me about that.

00:17:02.408 --> 00:17:06.057
JS: Well, Marilyn started --

00:17:06.081 --> 00:17:09.528
there she is up there,
my beautiful wife --

00:17:09.552 --> 00:17:12.524
she started the foundation
about 20 years ago.

00:17:12.548 --> 00:17:13.699
I think '94.

00:17:13.723 --> 00:17:15.818
I claim it was '93, she says it was '94,

00:17:15.842 --> 00:17:18.413
but it was one of those two years.

00:17:18.437 --> 00:17:20.572
(Laughter)

00:17:20.596 --> 00:17:27.315
We started the foundation,
just as a convenient way to give charity.

00:17:28.346 --> 00:17:30.853
She kept the books, and so on.